    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_actions_archive">移至這則訊息。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Swipe up">%1$s</xliff:g>或<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Swipe down">%2$s</xliff:g>可瀏覽它的動作。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Double-tap">%3$s</xliff:g>可執行聽到的動作。執行「<xliff:g id="action" example="Archive">%4$s</xliff:g>」。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_actions_intro">有些項目除了啟用之外還有其他動作，例如訊息的「封存」或「刪除」。這類項目取得焦點時，「操作」朗讀控制項可瀏覽這些動作。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_actions_title">操作</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_button">移至「<xliff:g id="button" example="Ring the bell">%2$s</xliff:g>」。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Double-tap">%1$s</xliff:g>即可啟用。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_check_box">用同樣的方式剔選「<xliff:g id="check_box" example="Extra cheese">%1$s</xliff:g>」。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_hold">有些項目按住時會執行其他操作。移至「<xliff:g id="button" example="Details">%2$s</xliff:g>」。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Double-tap and hold">%1$s</xliff:g>即可按住。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_intro">啟用作用於取得焦點的項目，無論你輕按螢幕的哪個位置。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_title">啟用項目</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_back_in_lesson">「返回」不會離開課程。如要選擇其他課程，請使用「目錄」。</string>
