    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_continuous_read_from_menu"><xliff:g id="gesture" example="Tap with 3 fingers">%1$s</xliff:g>可開啟 SandFly 選單，然後選擇「<xliff:g id="command" example="Read from focused item">%2$s</xliff:g>」。</string>
